我也知道，那对你来说简直是地狱。
And I know
that's your idea of hell.

534
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:41,920
~其实挺不错的，因为你……
~[结巴] 你们怎么弄的？
-But it's quite nice,
because you...
-[STAMMERING] You do what?

535
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:43,560
我们把领航员的名字放帽子里抓阄。
We choose the co-driver's name
out of a hat.

536
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:45,640
所以你可能最后跟一个友善的大胡子大叔搭档。
So you could end up with
friendly men with beard.

537
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:47,680
完全有可能，绝对的。
You could. Absolutely.

538
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:50,840
但十有八九，
最后分给你的
是大胡子友善大叔的老婆。
But more often than not,
you end up with friendly man
with beard's wife.

539
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:53,080
~其实蛮有意思的。
~也留着大胡子。
-Which is actually quite fun.
-Also with beard.

540
00:25:53,120 --> 00:25:54,200
没错，绝对是的。
Yes, absolutely.

541
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,520
我跟你们讲啊。
I'll tell you what.

542
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:59,160
前几天我们还在琢磨呢，呃……
We were thinking
the other day about, um...

543
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:02,720
找那种画风最违和的人
来朗读极其硬核的汽车评测。
Inappropriate people
for reading out
really heavy-duty car stuff.

544
00:26:02,760 --> 00:26:06,560
既然你今天来了，能用那种腔调读一下这些吗？先从……
And since you're here,
can you just read those out
in the style, starting with...

545
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:09,560
第一段，你能用朱利安·克拉里的娘炮妖娆腔读一下吗？
That first bit,
can you read it
in the style of Julian Clary?

546
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:12,120
~这都是正儿八经的汽车评测？
~对，全都是出自……
-And this is kosher
car reviews?
-Yeah, that's all come out...

547
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:14,320
全是从汽车杂志上摘下来的，行吧？
That all comes off magazines.
Okay?

548
00:26:14,360 --> 00:26:16,640
~但要用朱利安·克拉里的腔调念。
~模仿朱利安·克拉里的风格。
-But Julian Clary reading.
-This is in the style
of Julian Clary.

549
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:19,040
[模仿克拉里妖娆腔]
一辆肌肉车，
家伙必须得够大。
[MIMICKING CLARY]
A muscle car
needs a big unit.

550
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:21,120
[观众大笑]
[LAUGHTER]

551
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:24,920
所以这台火鸟搭载了一台400立方英寸的V8发动机，
Which is why the Firebird
runs a 400 cubic inch V8

552
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:27,600
配上一台粗暴的地排四速手动变速箱。
hooked to a
four-on-the-floor
transmission.

553
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,560
为了显摆你的真本色，
And to show you are
packing real power,

554
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:33,240
机盖上的两只进气斗
直接把空气狠狠怼进化油器里。
two bonnets scoops
literally ram air
into the carburettor.

555
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:34,840
[观众哄堂大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

556
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,320
来，最后一段换查尔斯王子的腔调。
Now, let's hit Prince Charles
for the final bit.

557
00:26:37,360 --> 00:26:39,880
[模仿查尔斯王子贵族腔]
这台……
这台改到顶的思域……
[MIMICKING PRINCE CHARLES]
This...
This maxed-out Civic...

558
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:47,040
……配备了一套极其刁钻的进气系统，
以及硬核氮气加速套件。
...runs a seriously
tricky intake
and hardcore nitrous kit.

559
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:49,320
[正常声音]
我觉得咱们应该换成纳尔逊·曼德拉。
[NORMAL VOICE]
I think we should switch
to Nelson Mandela.

560
00:26:49,360 --> 00:26:51,360
[模仿曼德拉]
而这套炸裂的车载音响……
[MIMICKING MANDELA]
Whilst the slamming ICE...

561
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:53,160
[爆发大笑]
[LOUD LAUGHTER]

562
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:57,280
……全都是一堆震耳欲聋的
12英寸深盆重低音炮。
...is all about a pack
of ear-splitting,
deep dish 12-inch-subs.

563
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:58,560
[笑声]
[LAUGHING]

564
00:26:58,600 --> 00:26:59,840
绝了！
Fantastic!

565
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,160
话说回来，天哪。
Now, God.

566
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:09,440
要我说，所有人里
说话最搞笑的绝对是……
I'll tell you who I think
talks the funniest
of the lot...

567
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:11,320
- 警察。
- 没错。
-The police.
-Yeah.

568
00:27:11,360 --> 00:27:12,880
你发现没有？
Have you noticed that?

569
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:15,640
他们到底是从哪儿学来
那种奇奇怪怪的官腔的？
Where do they learn to talk
that language that they do?

570
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:17,400
尤其是交警，
特别奇葩。
Traffic police.
It's a strange thing.

571
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,440
我有一次超速被逮了，
就在巴恩斯。
I was done once
for speeding,
it was in Barnes.

572
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:22,040
当时电视上正好
在播《傲慢与偏见》。
And it was when
Pride and Prejudice
was on the telly.

573
00:27:22,080 --> 00:27:24,080
我急着想赶在九点前回家，
And I was trying
to get home for 9:00

574
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:27,280
在限速30英里的路上
开了差不多……35英里吧。
and I was doing,
I think, 35
in a 30-mile-an-hour limit.

575
00:27:27,320 --> 00:27:29,360
- 噢，惨了！
- 可不是嘛，千真万确。
-Oh, no!
-I know. True.

576
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,960
反正你懂的，他们把你拦下，
So anyway,
you know they stop you

577
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:32,920
然后那动作
简直是慢得要死。
and you know
how they take
a very, very long time.

578
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:34,480
我就说：“警察同志，实在对不住，
And I said,
"Look, I'm so sorry.

579
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:36,240
“主要是《傲慢与偏见》
九点就要播了，
"It's just that
Pride and Prejudice
starts at 9:00

580
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:37,760
“我就是想赶紧赶回家。
"and I was just
trying to get home.

581
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:39,320
“我知道超速很蠢……”
[嘟嘟囔囔模仿]
"I know, it was
really stupid..."
[VOCALISING]

582
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:41,200
“稍安勿躁，先生，
急不得，慢慢来。”
"All in good time, sir.
All in good time."

583
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:45,360
然后他绕着轮胎打量了一圈，
And then he looks
around the tyres,

584
00:27:45,400 --> 00:27:47,440
又打量了一番车屁股，接着……
looks around
the back of the car
and then...

585
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,760
真不知道是谁给他们写的台词。
I don't know who
writes these speeches.

586
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:51,280
他走回来对我说：
He then came back and he said,

587
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:56,720
“好吧，布莱姆纳先生，
我就放您上路吧，”他说，
"Well, Mr Bremner,
I shall let you on your way,"
he said.

588
00:27:56,760 --> 00:28:00,000
“在下可不敢耽误您
品读传世名著。”
"Far be it from me
to keep you
from the classics."

589
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:01,760
[全场哄笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

590
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:04,840
他们就不能好好说人话吗？
Why can't they speak?

591
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:07,240
牛津郡肯定有家培训学院，
专门教他们这套新词典。
There is a training college
in Oxfordshire where they are
taught this new dictionary.

592
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:09,200
太诡异了。好了不说这个，听着。
It's bizarre.
Now anyway, listen.

593
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:11,040
你上过我们的赛道了，显而易见。
You've been out
on our track. Obviously.

594
00:28:11,080 --> 00:28:12,760
好玩吗？
Fun, was it?

595
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:15,760
赛道挺好玩的。
那台Liana嘛……开起来有点肉。
The track was fun.
The Liana was...
Was on the slow side.

596
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:18,120
现场有谁想看
罗里的练习赛画面吗？
And who'd like to see
some of Rory's practices?

597
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,720
- 观众：想看！
- 想看？
-AUDIENCE: Yes.
-Yes?

598
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:22,040
练习赛？
你们没告诉我连练习赛都拍了啊！
Practices?
You didn't tell me
you were filming them.

599
00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:24,200
不，练习赛当然拍了，
那必须拍啊。
No, we were
filming the practices.
Of course we were.

600
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,640
一起来瞧瞧。
Let's have a look.

601
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:28,240
他过来了。速度挺快。
车身晃了一下。
Here he comes. Quite fast.
Bit of a wobble.

602
00:28:29,320 --> 00:28:30,720
喔噢！
Ooh!

603
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:36,360
-瞧瞧，我这两只手在瞎忙活什么呢？
-[笑声]
-Look, what am I doing
with my hands?
-[LAUGHTER]

604
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:39,320
上周桑吉夫出状况时
也是一模一样的反应。
That's exactly
what happened
to Sanjeev last week.

605
00:28:39,360 --> 00:28:40,760
不过你至少救回来了。
And you've held it together.

606
00:28:40,800 --> 00:28:43,880
不像他，
最后直接开成倒车入弯了。
Unlike him,
who ended up going backwards.

607
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:47,360
不过单说这一圈的表现……
But as far as the lap
itself is concerned...

608
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,760
-呃……
-还满意吗？
-Uh...
-Pleased?

609
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:50,880
还行吧……
怎么说呢……
Yeah...
It's one of those...

610
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:53,160
节目组就给跑个
一两圈，然后……
You're given
a couple of laps
and it was...

611
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:55,400
才不止一两圈呢。
你一共跑了几圈？
You're not given a couple.
How many laps
were you allowed to do?

612
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:58,680
-九圈。
-九圈，瞧瞧吧。
-Nine.
-Nine, you see.

613
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:02,040
想不想看看
这九圈跑出来的成果？想看吗？
Would you like to see
the results of this
nine laps? Yes?

614
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:03,320
观众：想！
AUDIENCE: Yes!

615
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:04,680
行，来看这一圈。
Okay, let's run the lap.

616
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,080
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

617
00:29:06,120 --> 00:29:07,520
冲，冲，冲！
Go, go, go!

618
00:29:07,560 --> 00:29:09,760
[笑声]
[LAUGHTER]

619
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:14,560
克拉克森：噢，
这块儿过得挺利落啊。
CLARKSON: Ooh,
that's quite tidy
through there.

620
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:15,960
那个弯可危险了。
That's a dangerous corner,
that one.

621
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:18,000
-说真的，让我刮目相看。
-哪有！
-Really, I'm impressed.
-Hardly!

622
00:29:18,040 --> 00:29:21,120
不，你看那个弯！
这是我见过切得最贴内线的了。
No, look at that!
That's the tightest
I've ever seen.

623
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:24,440
这下好多了。冲！
That's better. Go!

624
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:27,240
-[轮胎尖叫声]
-克拉克森：
这就差点意思了。
-[TYRES SCREECHING]
-CLARKSON:
That's less satisfactory.

625
00:29:27,280 --> 00:29:28,600
布伦姆纳：从内线切过去的。
BREMNER: From the inside.

626
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:31,680
教练，你还好吧？
You all right, instructor?

627
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:33,480
克拉克森：好，这里是贯通弯。
CLARKSON: Okay, this is
the follow-through.

628
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,040
非常吓人的弯，
可以全油门通过。
Scary corner,
you can do it flat-out.

629
00:29:35,080 --> 00:29:36,720
-你过那儿是全油门吗？
-对。
-Were you flat-out
through there?
-Yeah.

630
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,720
克拉克森：好样的。
CLARKSON: Good man.

631
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,600
-这是什么弯，倒数第二个？
-对。
-What's this,
second to last?
-Yeah.

632
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:42,400
克拉克森：这简直就像
以时速100英里穿针引线。
CLARKSON: That's like
threading a needle at
a 100 miles an hour.

633
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:45,200
你救过来了，
剧烈摆尾。穿过……
You've got that one,
a tank slapper. Through...

634
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:46,600
布伦姆纳：我在这里失控了。
BREMNER: I lost it here.

635
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,960
噢，非常漂亮，
冲线了！
Ooh, very good,
and across the line!

636
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:50,320
[欢呼声]
[CHEERING]

637
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,160
那么……
Now...

638
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:59,800
-你觉得成绩能排第几？
-怎么着也能排在理查德·怀特利前面吧。
-How do you think you've done?
-Somewhere in front
of Richard Whiteley.

639
00:29:59,840 --> 00:30:01,400
-他排在哪儿来着？
-在那个，呃……
-Where was he?
-Somewhere, ah...

640
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:04,800
怀特利！有人把榜单上的
怀特利给偷走了！
Whiteley! Somebody's stolen
Whiteley from the board!

641
00:30:04,840 --> 00:30:06,920
或者他直接掉下榜单，
摔地上了。
Or maybe he's dropped
off the floor.

642
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:09,680
恩菲尔德在最底下垫底。
现在，怀特利是2分06秒。
Enfield's sitting at
the bottom. Now, Whiteley's
two minutes, six seconds.

643
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,440
-哦。
-不可思议。
-Oh.
-Unbelievable.

644
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:14,120
-不过，我得把你名字故意拼错……
-凭什么？
-Well, I'm going to have
to spell your name wrong...
-Why?

645
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:16,760
-因为我上周把桑吉夫的名字给拼错了。
-噢，好吧。
-Well because I did
Sanjeev wrong last week.
-Oh, right.

646
00:30:16,800 --> 00:30:20,040
所以原本该加在他名字里的
那两个字母“E”，正好贴你这儿。
So you can have
the double "E's" that
I should have put in his name.

647
00:30:20,080 --> 00:30:22,440
-太棒了。
-你可以改叫“Roree”。
-Goody.
-You could be "Roree."

648
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:26,600
-更难听的外号我都听过。
-你跑出来的成绩是——
1分40……
-I've been called worse.
-You did it in
one minute forty.

649
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:29,560
相当快。
So very fast.

650
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:32,280
……7秒9！
Seven. Point nine.

651
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:34,080
哇哦！哎哟！
Oof. Oof!

652
00:30:34,120 --> 00:30:38,720
你是在这条赛道上跑过的所有人里，
历史第二快的！
You are the second
fastest person ever
to go round the track!

653
00:30:39,720 --> 00:30:41,320
我还以为会垫在老后面呢！
I thought it was way down!

654
00:30:41,360 --> 00:30:42,840
并没有！
No!

655
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,160
瞧瞧这个！
Look at that!

656
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:48,640
而且我不得不说……
不仅成绩拔尖，
And I've gotta say...
And not just doing it,

657
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:51,640
你居然还在开的过程中，
一路模仿默里·沃克耍宝开玩笑。
but actually joking around
with the Murray Walker stuff
in the process.

658
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:54,680
[笑]
我实在忍不住嘛。
不过这……我自己都惊了。
[LAUGHS]
Well I had to do that.
But it's a... I'm surprised.

659
00:30:54,720 --> 00:30:57,400
你居然……“惊了”？
我就喜欢你这种装低调！
Have you ever..."Surprised"?
I love the underplay!

660
00:30:57,440 --> 00:30:58,520
-“哎呀，人家好惊讶呢。”
-真不是装的！
-"Oh, I'm surprised."
-No!

661
00:30:58,560 --> 00:31:00,440
我是真吃惊，
因为开的时候根本心里没底！
I was,
because you've got no idea!

662
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:03,120
大家跑完总问：
“怎么样？跑得如何？”
别人就直摇头：呃……
People say, used to say,
"How's that? How's that?"
They go, ooh...

663
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:05,640
不，刚才那圈……
一眼就能看出来
跑得特别干净利落。
No, that was...
You can just tell
that was a tidy lap.

664
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:08,320
你现实中真见过默里·沃克吗？
Have you ever actually met
Murray Walker?

665
00:31:08,360 --> 00:31:10,320
见过，我们一起办过大会。
当时我们要介绍他上台。
Yes, I have.
We did a conference together.
We had to introduce him.

666
00:31:10,360 --> 00:31:14,040
我就问他，解说了30年赛车，
在这么多年里，哪一位是
And I said to him, 30 years
of motor racing commentary,
who's the one person that

667
00:31:14,080 --> 00:31:16,320
您见过的所有人中
最让人印象深刻、
stands out as the most
impressive person
you've ever met

668
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:18,760
整个赛车圈里最拔尖的人物？
in the whole years
of motor racing?

669
