1059
00:54:09,880 --> 00:54:12,080
-梅：这就是个大玩具，根本不是车。
-哈蒙德：一点没错。
-MAY: It's a toy. Not a car.
-HAMMOND: Exactly.

1060
00:54:12,120 --> 00:54:15,920
克拉克森：我们谁也说服不了谁，
于是决定换着开开对方的车。
CLARKS ON: We still couldn't
agree, so we thought we'd try
each other's cars.

1061
00:54:18,040 --> 00:54:21,240
-[按喇叭]
-真够窝囊的喇叭，
听听这动静！
-[HONKING]
-Pathetic horn, I mean,
listen to that!

1062
00:54:22,080 --> 00:54:23,560
[按喇叭]
[HONKS]

1063
00:54:23,600 --> 00:54:24,920
“滚开，别挡道！”
"Get out the way!"

1064
00:54:28,080 --> 00:54:31,560
你还可以把领养老金的存折，
塞进这根小皮带底下。
You tuck your pension book
into that little
strap thing there.

1065
00:54:38,960 --> 00:54:40,000
哇哦！
Whoa!

1066
00:54:42,280 --> 00:54:44,480
好家伙，
这车简直快得吓死人！
Now, that is
terrifyingly quick!

1067
00:54:44,520 --> 00:54:47,240
不过，我倒真有点想……
But, I quite fancy...

1068
00:54:47,280 --> 00:54:50,640
说不上来，就是坐进罗孚里
舒舒服服地放松一把。
I dunno, a nice relaxing
ride in a Rover.

1069
00:54:50,680 --> 00:54:52,040
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SQUEAL]

1070
00:54:52,080 --> 00:54:52,960
我的妈呀！
Oh, my God!

1071
00:54:57,920 --> 00:54:58,840
噢！
Oh!

1072
00:54:59,720 --> 00:55:01,120
老子差点被直接甩飞出去！
I bloody nearly
fell out of it!

1073
00:55:05,840 --> 00:55:08,760
我发誓，哈蒙德这家伙……
有时候……
I swear, Hammond...
Sometimes...

1074
00:55:10,000 --> 00:55:11,600
我真搞不懂那小子脑子里在想什么。
I don't understand that boy.

1075
00:55:13,560 --> 00:55:15,200
-怎么了？
-我告诉你怎么了！
-What?
-I'll tell you what!

1076
00:55:15,240 --> 00:55:17,640
-你平时住的是砖房还是谷仓？
-房子。
-Do you live in a house
or a barn?
-A house.

1077
00:55:17,680 --> 00:55:21,640
-你睡觉是睡在床上还是睡在干草堆上？
-呃……显而易见是床上。
-Do you sleep on a bed
or on a bale of straw?
-Oh... A bed, obviously.

1078
00:55:21,680 --> 00:55:23,560
得了吧，这玩意儿就是个浴室塑料洁具。
Come on, this is
a bathroom appliance.

1079
00:55:23,600 --> 00:55:26,560
-才不是！
-它根本就是塑料做的！
-It is not!
-It's plastic!

1080
00:55:26,600 --> 00:55:30,320
行了行了，听我说咱们接下来怎么办，
别吵了。
Okay, okay, I'll tell
you what we'll do.
No more arguing.

1081
00:55:30,360 --> 00:55:31,680
咱们投票决定，行吧？
We'll put it to
the vote, okay?

1082
00:55:31,720 --> 00:55:33,160
怎么着，咱们突然讲起民主了？
So, we're a democracy
all of a sudden?

1083
00:55:33,200 --> 00:55:35,320
-对，现在讲民主了。
-这可真是破天荒头一回。
-Yeah, we're a democracy now.
-That's a first.

1084
00:55:35,360 --> 00:55:39,280
女士们先生们，
支持罗孚75的，
请举手！
Ladies and gentlemen,
can I have a show of hands,
please, for the Rover 75!

1085
00:55:39,320 --> 00:55:40,320
-[跺脚声]
-[笑声]
-[STOMPS]
-[LAUGHS]

1086
00:55:43,240 --> 00:55:45,560
就三个人举手，詹姆斯。
That's three, James.

1087
00:55:45,600 --> 00:55:48,720
行吧。女士们先生们，
请为霸气的摩根举手！
Okay. Ladies and gentlemen,
show of hands, please,
for the mighty Morgan.

1088
00:55:49,760 --> 00:55:51,360
哟，还真不少。
Ooh, that's not bad.

1089
00:55:51,400 --> 00:55:54,720
举手的全是大爷。
That's all
the elderly gentlemen.

1090
00:55:54,760 --> 00:55:59,160
那咱们赶紧给这轮收个尾，
支持诺博（Noble）的请举手。
And can we just round this
one off now please,
for the Noble.

1091
00:56:00,160 --> 00:56:02,200
漂亮！
Yes!

1092
00:56:02,240 --> 00:56:07,360
看吧，完全是压倒性胜利，
最佳英国车非它莫属——真是这样吗？
There you go, a complete
wipe out, the best British
car or is it?

1093
00:56:07,400 --> 00:56:10,400
刚才，我试驾了MG SV。
Earlier on, I tried the MG SV.

1094
00:56:10,440 --> 00:56:13,840
我们当时觉得它要是值7.5万英镑，
And we reckoned it would
be worth £75,000

1095
00:56:13,880 --> 00:56:18,680
前提得是能在我们的赛道上，
把德国人揍得鼻青脸肿。
if it could go out on
our track and give the Germans
a bloody nose.

1096
00:56:18,720 --> 00:56:20,800
所以，让那家伙出征吧。
So, let's fire him up.

1097
00:56:20,840 --> 00:56:23,640
福瑟灵顿·迪格比·斯提格比上校！
Colonel Fotherington
Digby Stigby.

1098
00:56:25,520 --> 00:56:27,880
克拉克森：大英帝国的无上荣耀，
CLARKS ON: So, the very
greatness of Britain

1099
00:56:27,920 --> 00:56:30,840
如今全担在他肩上，斯提格出发了！
resting on his shoulders,
the Stig is away.

1100
00:56:30,880 --> 00:56:33,680
今天赛道是干的，
所以这台MG拥有
And the track is dry today
so the MG has the best

1101
00:56:33,720 --> 00:56:37,560
最绝佳的机会，
能把对手狠狠痛扁一顿。
possible chance
to give a good drubbing.

1102
00:56:37,600 --> 00:56:39,840
[贝多芬《致爱丽丝》响起]
[FUR ELISEBY BEETHOVEN PLAYS]

1103
00:56:39,880 --> 00:56:44,800
克拉克森：这放的是德国音乐！
叛徒斯提格竟然在听贝多芬！
CLARKS ON: That's German music!
The treacherous Stig's
listening to Beethoven!

1104
00:56:44,840 --> 00:56:48,720
不过在他脑子里，这大概也就是
IBM广告里的调调吧。
Although he probably knows it
simply as the tune
from the IBM ad.

1105
00:56:48,760 --> 00:56:52,680
出芝加哥弯看着有点不利索，
锤头弯表现又如何？
That looked ragged out
of Chicago there,
what about Hammerhead?

1106
00:56:52,720 --> 00:56:56,080
哎哟，入弯推头了……
Ooh, understeer
on the way in there...

1107
00:56:56,120 --> 00:57:00,600
接着……这又怎么了？
还有点转向过度。
这跑得可真不怎么样。
And then... What have we got?
A little bit of oversteer.
This isn't all that brilliant.

1108
00:57:00,640 --> 00:57:01,720
说句实在话。
Must be honest.

1109
00:57:01,760 --> 00:57:02,720
[音乐继续]
[MUSIC CONTINUES]

1110
00:57:04,680 --> 00:57:07,800
逼近连贯弯了。
这弯道可凶险得很。
Coming down to
the follow-through.
Scary corner, this.

1111
00:57:07,840 --> 00:57:10,760
相当凶险。瞧瞧这重刹点头的幅度！
Very scary. And look at the
dive under braking.

1112
00:57:10,800 --> 00:57:12,720
我几乎已经能听到，
Almost here,
the stifled laughter

1113
00:57:12,760 --> 00:57:15,360
斯图加特那边传来的嗤笑了！
echoing around Stuttgart's!

1114
00:57:15,400 --> 00:57:18,680
好了，倒数第二个弯。
斯提格能重现1945年的辉煌吗？
Okay, second to last corner.
Can the Stig make
it 1945 again?

1115
00:57:18,720 --> 00:57:23,680
哪怕重演1966年也成啊！
冲线！
Or even just 1966 would do!
Across the line!

1116
00:57:23,720 --> 00:57:26,360
-好了，它真正要挑战的成绩在这儿！
-对。
-Now, this is what it's
really got to be!
-Yep.

1117
00:57:26,400 --> 00:57:29,160
宝马M3 CSL，整整1分28秒。
M3 CSL, 1 minute 28, dead.

1118
00:57:29,200 --> 00:57:34,360
保时捷911 GT3，1分27秒2，
而且那些可都是在湿地跑出来的。
911 GT3, 1.27.2,
and they were done
on wet tracks.

1119
00:57:34,400 --> 00:57:35,960
-没错。
-它的成绩是……
-Yeah.
-It did it.

1120
00:57:36,480 --> 00:57:37,600
快念啊！
Go on!

1121
00:57:37,640 --> 00:57:41,080
1分28秒6。
One minute twenty
eight point six.

1122
00:57:41,120 --> 00:57:42,600
[全场哀嚎]
[ALL GROAN]

1123
00:57:42,640 --> 00:57:45,800
“喷火”终究还是输给了“梅塞施密特”。
The Spitfire has lost to
the Messerschmitts.

1124
00:57:47,360 --> 00:57:49,520
要不听听我这个主意？
So how about this for an idea?

1125
00:57:49,560 --> 00:57:53,680
咱们给它加套氮气加速，再来比一场？如何？
We put some nitrous on it
and have a rematch? Yes?

1126
00:57:53,720 --> 00:57:55,840
主意不错，改天咱们一定试试。
That's a good idea,
we'll do that one day.

1127
00:57:55,880 --> 00:57:57,040
至于现在，大家晚安！
For now, goodnight!

